<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>荒野先锋·少年户外突破成长营</title>
<meta property="og:title" content="荒野先锋·少年户外突破成长营">
<meta property="og:description" content="2026暑假 · 深圳龙华 · 7天6夜 · 16人精品小团 · 7月20日出发">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--dark:#0d1a0f;--forest:#1a3320;--fire:#e8631a;--amber:#f0a500;--earth:#c4956a;--khaki:#8b7355;--sand:#d4c4a8;--white:#faf8f4}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--dark);color:var(--sand);font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity 0.65s ease,transform 0.65s ease}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
@keyframes fadeDown{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-18px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:0.4}}
.open .dtoggle{transform:rotate(180deg)!important}
.open .dbody{display:block!important}
.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(45,90,61,0.35);}
.faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.faq-item.faq-open .faq-arrow{transform:rotate(180deg);}
.faq-item.faq-open .faq-body{display:block!important;}
.policy-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;}
.policy-table th{background:rgba(232,99,26,0.2);color:#f0a500;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;letter-spacing:1px;border:1px solid rgba(232,99,26,0.2);}
.policy-table td{padding:9px 12px;color:#d4c4a8;border:1px solid rgba(45,90,61,0.3);line-height:1.6;}
.policy-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(45,90,61,0.12);}
.qr-hint{font-size:10px;color:#8b7355;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;}
#ls{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#0d1a0f;z-index:9999;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;transition:opacity 0.4s ease;}
#ls.hide{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.ld-title{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0a500,#e8631a);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;}
.ld-sub{font-size:11px;color:#8b7355;letter-spacing:3px;}
.ld-bw{width:200px;height:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);overflow:hidden;border-radius:2px;}
.ld-b{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8631a,#f0a500);width:0;transition:width 0.12s ease;}
.ld-pct{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#e8631a;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="ls">
  <svg width="68" height="68" viewBox="0 0 120 120" style="filter:drop-shadow(0 0 16px rgba(232,99,26,0.5))">
    <polygon points="60,8 108,30 108,75 60,112 12,75 12,30" fill="none" stroke="#e8631a" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.65"/>
    <polygon points="60,18 98,36 98,72 60,102 22,72 22,36" fill="none" stroke="#f0a500" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/>
    <polygon points="30,78 50,45 60,55 70,38 90,78" fill="#2d5a3d"/>
    <circle cx="70" cy="42" r="8" fill="#f0a500" opacity="0.9"/>
    <circle cx="70" cy="42" r="5" fill="#e8631a"/>
    <text x="60" y="95" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#f0a500" font-family="serif">★ ★ ★</text>
  </svg>
  <div class="ld-title">荒野先锋</div>
  <div class="ld-sub">少年户外突破成长营 · 2026</div>
  <div class="ld-bw"><div class="ld-b" id="lb"></div></div>
  <div class="ld-pct" id="lp">0%</div>
</div>
<div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8631a,#f0a500);padding:10px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0d1a0f;letter-spacing:2px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:999;">⚡ 早鸟优惠截止6月1日 · 16人精品小团 · 7月20日出发</div>
<section style="min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(13,26,15,0.2) 0%,rgba(13,26,15,0.75) 55%,#0d1a0f 100%),linear-gradient(135deg,#0d1a0f,#1a2e1c,#0f1f12);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:60px 24px 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.1;">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="object-fit:cover;width:33.33%;height:100%;filter:grayscale(60%);" alt="">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="object-fit:cover;width:33.33%;height:100%;filter:grayscale(60%);" alt="">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="object-fit:cover;width:33.33%;height:100%;filter:grayscale(60%);" alt="">
  </div>
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(45,90,61,0.07) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(45,90,61,0.07) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px;pointer-events:none;"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;text-align:center;">
    <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(232,99,26,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(232,99,26,0.4);color:#e8631a;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;padding:7px 18px;margin-bottom:28px;animation:fadeDown 0.8s ease both;">◆ 2026夏令营 ◆</div>
    <div style="width:90px;height:90px;margin:0 auto 22px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(232,99,26,0.4));animation:fadeDown 0.9s ease 0.1s both;">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:100%;">
        <polygon points="60,8 108,30 108,75 60,112 12,75 12,30" fill="none" stroke="#e8631a" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.65"/>
        <polygon points="60,18 98,36 98,72 60,102 22,72 22,36" fill="none" stroke="#f0a500" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/>
        <polygon points="30,78 50,45 60,55 70,38 90,78" fill="#2d5a3d"/>
        <circle cx="70" cy="42" r="8" fill="#f0a500" opacity="0.9"/>
        <circle cx="70" cy="42" r="5" fill="#e8631a"/>
        <text x="60" y="95" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#f0a500" font-family="serif">★ ★ ★</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <span style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,68px);font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:6px;display:block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0a500,#c4956a,#e8631a);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;animation:fadeDown 1s ease 0.2s both;">荒野先锋</span>
    <span style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:clamp(14px,4vw,20px);font-weight:400;color:#d4c4a8;letter-spacing:7px;margin-top:12px;display:block;animation:fadeDown 1s ease 0.3s both;">少年户外突破成长营</span>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:26px auto;max-width:280px;animation:fadeDown 1s ease 0.35s both;">
      <div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#8b7355,transparent);"></div>
      <span style="color:#e8631a;font-size:16px;">✦</span>
      <div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#8b7355,transparent);"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;animation:fadeDown 1s ease 0.4s both;">
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.3);color:#d4c4a8;font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;letter-spacing:1px;">📍 深圳·龙华</div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.3);color:#d4c4a8;font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;letter-spacing:1px;">📅 7月20—26日</div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.3);color:#d4c4a8;font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;letter-spacing:1px;">🎒 7—12岁</div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.3);color:#d4c4a8;font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;letter-spacing:1px;">🏕️ 7天6夜</div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:34px;animation:fadeDown 1s ease 0.5s both;">
      <button onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})" style="display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8631a,#f0a500);color:#0d1a0f;font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:4px;padding:16px 44px;border:none;cursor:pointer;clip-path:polygon(8px 0%,100% 0%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0% 100%);">立即报名</button>
      <p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;color:#8b7355;letter-spacing:2px;">早鸟价 4380元 · 截止6月1日 · 仅限16人</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8631a,#f0a500);padding:26px 24px;">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;border-right:1px solid rgba(13,26,15,0.2);"><span style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#0d1a0f;line-height:1;display:block;">7</span><div style="font-size:10px;color:rgba(13,26,15,0.7);margin-top:3px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;">天 6 夜</div></div>
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;border-right:1px solid rgba(13,26,15,0.2);"><span style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#0d1a0f;line-height:1;display:block;">16</span><div style="font-size:10px;color:rgba(13,26,15,0.7);margin-top:3px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;">精品名额</div></div>
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;border-right:1px solid rgba(13,26,15,0.2);"><span style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#0d1a0f;line-height:1;display:block;">20+</span><div style="font-size:10px;color:rgba(13,26,15,0.7);margin-top:3px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;">拓展项目</div></div>
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;"><span style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#0d1a0f;line-height:1;display:block;">3</span><div style="font-size:10px;color:rgba(13,26,15,0.7);margin-top:3px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;">次授勋仪式</div></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:3px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:190px;width:auto;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0.85);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:190px;width:auto;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0.85);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:190px;width:auto;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0.85);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:190px;width:auto;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0.85);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:190px;width:auto;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0.85);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:190px;width:auto;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0.85);" alt=""></div>
<div style="background:#1a3320;padding:64px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
<div style="position:absolute;right:-15px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:220px;color:rgba(45,90,61,0.22);pointer-events:none;line-height:1;">16</div>
<div style="max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:2;">
<div class="reveal"><div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#e8631a;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">核心优势</div><h2 style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,6vw,34px);font-weight:900;color:#faf8f4;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:20px;">同样的价格<br><span style='color:#e8631a;'>我们只有16个名额</span></h2></div>
<div class="reveal" style="background:rgba(13,26,15,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.2);border-left:3px solid #e8631a;padding:20px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:44px;color:rgba(232,99,26,0.18);position:absolute;right:14px;top:6px;line-height:1;">01</div><div style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#f0a500;margin-bottom:7px;">🎯 16人精品小团</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#d4c4a8;">同类营地普遍<strong style='color:#e8631a'>20人成团</strong>，我们严格控制在<strong style='color:#e8631a'>16人</strong>。每个孩子被教练看见的机会更多，成长更扎实。</div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:3px;margin:14px 0;"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(0.88);display:block;" alt=""><div style="position:absolute;bottom:7px;left:7px;background:rgba(13,26,15,0.82);border-left:2px solid #e8631a;color:#d4c4a8;font-size:10px;padding:3px 9px;letter-spacing:1px;">丛林穿越</div></div><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(0.88);display:block;" alt=""><div style="position:absolute;bottom:7px;left:7px;background:rgba(13,26,15,0.82);border-left:2px solid #e8631a;color:#d4c4a8;font-size:10px;padding:3px 9px;letter-spacing:1px;">高空挑战</div></div></div>
<div class="reveal" style="background:rgba(13,26,15,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.2);border-left:3px solid #e8631a;padding:20px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:44px;color:rgba(232,99,26,0.18);position:absolute;right:14px;top:6px;line-height:1;">02</div><div style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#f0a500;margin-bottom:7px;">🏗️ 真实挑战 不是表演</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#d4c4a8;">建木屋、发火箭、野外炊事……<strong style='color:#e8631a'>每一项都真实发生</strong>，每个成果孩子自己完成，不是老师帮忙收尾。</div></div>
<div class="reveal" style="background:rgba(13,26,15,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.2);border-left:3px solid #e8631a;padding:20px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:44px;color:rgba(232,99,26,0.18);position:absolute;right:14px;top:6px;line-height:1;">03</div><div style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#f0a500;margin-bottom:7px;">🏅 三次庄重授勋仪式</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#d4c4a8;">每隔两天一次授勋，<strong style='color:#e8631a'>让孩子亲身感受「我做到了」</strong>。这种正向反馈比任何说教都有力量。</div></div>
<div class="reveal" style="background:rgba(13,26,15,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(196,149,106,0.2);border-left:3px solid #e8631a;padding:20px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:44px;color:rgba(232,99,26,0.18);position:absolute;right:14px;top:6px;line-height:1;">04</div><div style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#f0a500;margin-bottom:7px;">💌 给爸爸妈妈的一封信</div><div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#d4c4a8;">第四天晚上，有一份特别的惊喜在等待孩子。看完之后，他们会提笔，给爸爸妈妈写下一封回信。<strong style='color:#e8631a'>很多孩子的第一封真正的信，从这里开始。</strong></div></div>
</div></div>
<div style="background:#1a3320;">
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="max-height:340px;width:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(0.8);display:block;" alt=""><div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(13,26,15,0.92));padding:36px 20px 18px;"><h3 style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:20px;color:#faf8f4;font-weight:900;">🔥 篝火晚会</h3><p style="font-size:12px;color:#d4c4a8;margin-top:5px;">D5夜晚 · 手牵手围着火光，这一刻属于所有荒野先锋</p></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:3px;margin:3px;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(0.88);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(0.88);" alt=""><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(0.88);" alt=""></div>
</div>
