<div style="background:#1a3320;padding:64px 20px;"><div style="max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="reveal"><div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#e8631a;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">常见问题</div><h2 style="font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,6vw,34px);font-weight:900;color:#faf8f4;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:20px;">家长最想知道的<span style='color:#e8631a'>5件事</span></h2></div><div class="reveal" style="background:rgba(13,26,15,0.5);border:1px solid rgba(45,90,61,0.4);overflow:hidden;"><div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 18px;cursor:pointer;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#e8631a;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1.4;">Q1</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#faf8f4;line-height:1.6;">入营后如何了解孩子的动态？</div></div><div class="faq-arrow" style="color:#e8631a;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:10px;transition:transform 0.3s;">▼</div></div><div class="faq-body" style="display:none;padding:0 18px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-size:13px;color:#d4c4a8;line-height:1.9;border-left:2px solid rgba(232,99,26,0.3);padding-left:14px;">导师每天会在群内分享活动影像，让家长及时了解孩子动态。营中（第3/4天）也会安排孩子与家长通话，其余时间建议「数字排毒」，减少依赖。</div></div></div>
<div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 18px;cursor:pointer;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#e8631a;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1.4;">Q2</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#faf8f4;line-height:1.6;">家长可以去营地探访孩子吗？</div></div><div class="faq-arrow" style="color:#e8631a;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:10px;transition:transform 0.3s;">▼</div></div><div class="faq-body" style="display:none;padding:0 18px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-size:13px;color:#d4c4a8;line-height:1.9;border-left:2px solid rgba(232,99,26,0.3);padding-left:14px;"><strong style='color:#f0a500'>不建议。</strong>独立是成长的必修课。家长的「退后」能为孩子建立心理韧性留出空间，我们邀您通过云端同步这份成长。</div></div></div>
<div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 18px;cursor:pointer;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#e8631a;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1.4;">Q3</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#faf8f4;line-height:1.6;">孩子可以和好朋友同宿吗？</div></div><div class="faq-arrow" style="color:#e8631a;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:10px;transition:transform 0.3s;">▼</div></div><div class="faq-body" style="display:none;padding:0 18px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-size:13px;color:#d4c4a8;line-height:1.9;border-left:2px solid rgba(232,99,26,0.3);padding-left:14px;"><strong style='color:#f0a500'>随机分组。</strong>离开社交舒适圈是培养「领导力」的开始。我们会通过引导，帮助孩子在陌生环境中建立新的人际连接。</div></div></div>
<div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 18px;cursor:pointer;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;"><div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#e8631a;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1.4;">Q4</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#faf8f4;line-height:1.6;">可以带手机或电子产品吗？</div></div><div class="faq-arrow" style="color:#e8631a;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:10px;transition:transform 0.3s;">▼</div></div><div class="faq-body" style="display:none;padding:0 18px 16px 48px;"><div style="font-size:13px;color:#d4c4a8;line-height:1.9;border-left:2px solid rgba(232,99,26,0.3);padding-left:14px;"><strong style='color:#f0a500'>统一保管。</strong>入营时交由导师，仅在通话日发放。让孩子暂时放下屏幕，全身心沉浸于自然与社交。</div></div></div>
